# OSW / OSWA (Obesity Surgery WA) — client context

Perth bariatric-surgery clinic. Work = full website rebuild proposal: sitemap, wireframes,
and ~27 SEO content pages, all served from this app under `/osw`.

## App code + content pipeline
- `src/app/osw/` — layout, landing page, `sitemap/`, `wireframes/`, `content/<slug>/` built pages
- Root `content-briefs/*.md` (23 briefs, tracked, Ahrefs-enriched) render live at
  `/osw/content-briefs/[slug]` via a `process.cwd()` read — **that folder must not move**
- Built pages use `src/components/osw/ContentPageTemplate.tsx`
- `PRODUCT.md` (here) — product brief: users, brand, design principles, WCAG AA

## Client-driven changes to know about (2026-06-22, PR #2)
- Added 3 post-surgery procedure pages (hiatus-hernia, gallbladder, skin-removal)
- **Payment plans retired** — pages 301-redirect to medicare (see `next.config.ts`)
- "Am I eligible" reframed to medical criteria

## Folder map
- `PRODUCT.md` — the OSW product brief (moved from repo root)
- `whatsapp-2026-06-22/` — client WhatsApp screenshots behind the PR #2 changes
