docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/gastric-bypass-perth.md:540:> Pre- and post-operative consultations take place at Garden City Specialist Centre in Booragoon and WA Cardiology Centre in Greenfields; you can also learn more about [hospital locations](/hospitals-locations) and the OSWA [surgeons](/surgeons) before booking.
