src/app/osw/content/gastric-sleeve-cost-perth/page.tsx:7:    "What does gastric sleeve surgery cost in Perth? Understand surgeon, hospital, anaesthetist and physician fees, Medicare rebates, private health and payment options.",
src/app/osw/content/gastric-sleeve-cost-perth/page.tsx:17:    "What does gastric sleeve surgery cost in Perth? Understand surgeon, hospital, anaesthetist and physician fees, Medicare rebates, private health and payment options.",
