   360	> **Can gastric bypass be covered by Medicare?** For Roux-en-Y gastric bypass, MBS item 31572 may apply when the relevant criteria are met, but Medicare does not usually cover every cost. Your surgeon can confirm whether an MBS item applies; your private health fund can confirm hospital-cover requirements, waiting periods and policy exclusions.
   361	
   362	Why it matters: Medicare coverage appears in current Google People-Also-Ask results and the current explanation is buried in a long cost paragraph.
   363	
