410:> Use our [am I eligible for weight loss surgery guide](/am-i-eligible) to calculate your BMI and understand the other factors your surgeon will consider.
438:> The Obesity Surgery WA surgical team performs gastric bypass surgery in Perth at the hospital location(s) confirmed by your surgeon. Pre- and post-operative consultations take place at Garden City Specialist Centre in Booragoon and WA Cardiology Centre in Greenfields.
448:> **Who is not eligible for gastric bypass?** For Medicare-funded bariatric surgery, a BMI below 40 without a major medical comorbidity, or a BMI below 35, does not meet the stated MBS eligibility threshold. Surgery may also be unsuitable if health risks, anatomy or the ability to follow long-term nutrition and follow-up need further assessment. Eligibility and alternatives must be discussed with your surgeon.
484:> You may need to follow a specific pre-operative diet for 2-4 weeks to reduce liver size and surgical risk, with guidance from the OSWA dietitian team.

